# Lorehold Charm, first mode: "Each opponent sacrifices a nontoken artifact of their choice." Bot2 controls two Moxen, a Clue
# token (a token artifact, from Thraben Inspector's investigate) and the Inspector (a creature, not an artifact). The Clue is
# refused as a choice (a token), Mox Jet is chosen and sacrificed: Mox Sapphire, the Clue and the Inspector stay. Bot1's own
# artifacts are untouched (Bot1's Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl). Bot1's graveyard is empty, so the return mode has no legal target and
# cannot be chosen, beside the first mode, which can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Lorehold Charm
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Thraben Inspector
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Plains x14

